# 在 PyCharm 里点左边的绿色三角即可发送

### 首页
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: application/json

### 添加菜谱
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/add_menu
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "回锅肉",
  "price": 32.5,
  "description": "肥而不腻"
}

### 查询单条
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/query_menu?menu_id=1
Accept: application/json

### 查询全部（支持模糊搜索 name）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/query_all_menu
Accept: application/json

### 模糊搜索
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/query_all_menu?name=鸡
Accept: application/json

### 更新（只传要改的字段）
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/update_menu?menu_id=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 35
}

### 删除
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/delete_menu?menu_id=1
Accept: application/json

### 随机推荐
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/recommend/simple?limit=3
Accept: application/json
